---
layout: base.njk
altUrl: /fr/
title: null
description: "SUNDROP puts on live music shows around Montreal: punk matinees, folk and jazz nights, poetry and more. Get tickets or apply to play."
---

<section class="hero">
  <div class="hero-text">
    {% include "hero-title.njk" %}
    <p class="hero-tagline">Punk matinees, folk and jazz nights, poetry with a backbeat. SUNDROP specializes in live debut music performances.</p>
    <p class="cta">
      <a class="button" href="{{ events.tickets }}" rel="noopener">Get tickets</a>
      <a class="button button-ghost" href="/book/">Play a show</a>
    </p>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="wall">
  <h2>Shows</h2>
  <ul class="gallery">
    {%- for e in events.upcoming %}{% include "poster.njk" %}{% endfor %}
    {%- for e in events.past %}{% include "poster.njk" %}{% endfor %}
    {%- if not events.upcoming.length %}
    {% include "next-card.njk" %}
    {%- endif %}
  </ul>
</section>

<section class="paths">
  <div>
    <h2>Come to a show</h2>
    <p>Click on the show poster to get your ticket. Grab yours on Bloom before the room fills.</p>
    <p><a href="{{ events.tickets }}" rel="noopener">See upcoming shows</a></p>
  </div>
  <div>
    <h2>Play a show</h2>
    <p>Looking to book a gig? Send us a link to your music and we'll find you a bill that fits.</p>
    <p><a href="/book/">Book a gig</a></p>
  </div>
  <div>
    <h2>Help out</h2>
    <p>We can always use a hand. Every volunteer gets into a show on us.</p>
    <p><a href="/get-involved/">Get involved</a></p>
  </div>
</section>
